          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto (sixth section of join): Moss. I,81C recto + Moss. I,81B recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Netzer and Todah.&rdquo;&nbsp;R. Yehoshu\u02bfa answered and said</li>\n<li>to Matai: &ldquo;Why is your name called Matai?&rdquo; He said to h[im</li>\n<li>... &ldquo;About] me David said, &lsquo;Matai will I come [and be seen before God?&rsquo;&rdquo;</li>\n<li>He said to him:]&nbsp;&ldquo;No, but about [you he said, &lsquo;Matai will he die, and] his name [per]ish&rsquo;.&rdquo;</li>\n<li>And he ordered [ ... ...&nbsp;And afterwards]</li>\n<li>he (i.e., Yehoshu\u02bfa ben Perah\u0323iah) brought Naqi and said to hi[m: &ldquo;Why is]</li>\n<li>your name [called] Naqi?&rdquo; He (Naqi) said to him: [&ldquo;About me David said],</li>\n<li>&lsquo;Neqi hands and a pure he[art&rsquo;.&rdquo; He said to him: &ldquo;Wicked person]</li>\n<li>son of a wicked person! Not th[us; about you]</li>\n<li>Moses [said], &lsquo;and He shall naqe [not yenaqe&rsquo;.&rdquo; And he ordered]</li>\n<li>and they threw h[im into a fiery furnace].</li>\n<li>After[wards they brought ...]</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
